  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Beginning at 2nd level, you apply a dodge bonus to the <a href=\"/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> of any <a href=\"/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> you Pilot. The dodge bonus is equal to one-half your Class Level, rounded down. Any condition that makes you lose your <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> also makes you lose dodge bonuses. Also, dodge bonuses stack with each other, unlike most other types of bonuses.</p>",
